# ctg-restic content: what a restore needs to keep the owner signed in everywhere (owner order 2026-11-03: never re-sign in after a reinstall).
# Checked after every backup (ctg-restic content); the freshness monitor on crystalcave alerts when the newest snapshot lacks one.
#   /path    must be in the snapshot if it exists on this host     !/path   must exist on this host too (and be in the snapshot)
